WEBVTT

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:04.410
Tutorial one. Load your data and define the groups.

00:00:05.468 --> 00:00:10.637
Start by loading your Excel file. You can browse for it, or paste its full path.

00:00:13.398 --> 00:00:19.636
The file is read straight from your disk. Nothing is uploaded. The app runs entirely on this computer.

00:00:19.906 --> 00:00:26.143
This is the example dataset that comes with the app. It has one row for each eye and each surgery.

00:00:26.407 --> 00:00:31.808
An example study is one click away. A preset holds every setting of one study.

00:00:34.555 --> 00:00:40.885
Tell the app which columns identify the patient and the eye, and which column defines the groups you want to compare.

00:00:41.125 --> 00:00:50.056
Name each group, and tick the values that belong to it. You can define two groups or more. Every comparison is made against the reference group.

00:00:50.312 --> 00:00:55.435
Live counts update as you work: the rows in the analysis, and the rows in each group.

00:00:55.763 --> 00:01:03.068
Save your own study as a preset. Reload it later, or send it to a colleague, and the analysis is reproduced exactly.

00:01:03.849 --> 00:01:08.322
StandardEyes. For ophthalmologists, by ophthalmologists.

